  "id": "codependency",
  "term": "codependency",
  "definition": "Codependency is a pattern of unhealthy relationship dependence marked by relying too much on another person emotionally, becoming overly entangled in the relationship, and repeatedly putting one’s own needs aside. In this source, it is treated as related to but different from addiction-like involvement in romantic relationships.",
